      "en": "So he went and took Gomer the daughter of Diblaim; and she conceived, and bore him a son.",
      "ko": "이에 저가 가서 디블라임의 딸 고멜을 취하였더니 저가 잉태하여 아들을 낳으매",
      "source_text_hash": "aee5837a200a44ed41a4350b5865cb41c075e4495a837c9ffec3d6143617fe5e",
      "translation_text_hash": "9ce6f9ee8e63774ca5121eb1d4d8b1a2a709c84cad98d11e7cc1ba1f57e0b430",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이에 저가 가서 디블라임의 딸 고멜을 취하였더니 저가 잉태하여 아들을 낳으매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9ce6f9ee8e63774ca5121eb1d4d8b1a2a709c84cad98d11e7cc1ba1f57e0b430"
